            "notes": "For Round Two: I like similar items but sometimes I might take all weapon upgrades.\n\nFor Mercy: Weapon Power + Weapon Speed both increase her healing/pistol - building both of these stats in my fav.\n\nWeapon Power = Increases the heal amount\nWeapon Speed = Increases how fast the heals tick.\n\n[Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391)  wear is still my fav early survival item. If I'm feeling extra rich, I might go for the  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a).\n\n[Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) is another option if the prices don't work out. So, I like to take any combination of these rare items depending on how much stadium cash I have.",
