            "notes": "For Round Three: I still like taking [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) - mainly for the heal/damage boost beam combo. Then I will sell any items necessary to buy my first epic item.\n\nMy favourite every round three is [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) - I just like to increase my team's damage output.  [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) is the only way to increase your % damage boost - weapon power does not affect damage boost!! But if you're struggling for heals, you could take [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124).",
